<title>SWEDEN: TABLE-SWEDISH JULY CARGO VOLUMES FALL FOUR PCT.</title>
<headline>TABLE-SWEDISH JULY CARGO VOLUMES FALL FOUR PCT.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish airports moved four percent less cargo in July 1997 compared to July 1996, Sweden's civil aviation administration Luftfartsverket said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>State-owned Luftfartsverket, which owns 14 civil airports and operates five other civil and military airports in Sweden, published the following figures about July airport activity. The cargo figures do not include trucked air freight.</p>
<p>Figures are compared to same 1996 period.</p>
<p> SWEDISH AIRPORT ACTIVITY	JULY		JAN-JULY</p>
<p>				 1997  Pct change   1997  Pct change</p>
<p> Cargo (in tonnes)	 10,876    -4	87,668     9</p>
<p> Mail (in tonnes)	   2,581    18	20,124    47</p>
<p> Landings		    26,689    10     201,843     6</p>
<p> Passengers (in millions) 1.502     9	10.871     8</p>
<p>-- Abigail Schmelz, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1003</p>
</text>
